{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51938","headline":"柔珠庵东壁题诗（句）（仙姑又尝於柔珠庵壁题一绝，字比晋人差，清婉少骨。壁後半毁，惟余「百尺」十三字，其下必「风」字也。後二句无人能续之者。） · 何仙姑","name":"柔珠庵东壁题诗（句）（仙姑又尝於柔珠庵壁题一绝，字比晋人差，清婉少骨。壁後半毁，惟余「百尺」十三字，其下必「风」字也。後二句无人能续之者。）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"百尺水帘飞白虹，笙箫松柏语天[风]。\n（嘉庆《广东通志》三二九《释老传》转引《罗浮山志会编》引明孙蕡《何仙姑记》）（〖1〗何仙姑诸诗，当皆出宋以後人依托。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"何仙姑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51938.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51938","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}